+
+| OptName               | Since | Binding | Type  | Units  | Default  | Range  |
+| --------------------- | ----- | ------- | ----- | ------ | -------- | ------ |
+| `SRTO_RCVTIMEO`       |       | post    | `int` | msecs  | -1       | -1..   |
+
+- **[GET or SET]** - Blocking mode receiving timeout (-1: infinite)
+---
+
+| OptName               | Since | Binding | Type   | Units  | Default | Range  |
+| --------------------- | ----- | ------- | ------ | ------ | ------- | ------ |
+| `SRTO_RENDEZVOUS`     |       | pre     | `bool` | false  | true    | false  |
